---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../../components/CtaBanner.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Client Testimonials | Ezra Maroc"
  description="Read success stories from our clients. Discover their experiences obtaining Moroccan nationality with Ezra Maroc's expert guidance."
  currentPage="testimonials"
  canonicalPath="/en/testimonials.html"
  pageCSS={['temoignages']}
>
  <main id="main-content" class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Our Client Testimonials</h1>
      <p>Our clients' journeys are our greatest pride. Discover their experiences and how Ezra Maroc helped bring their Moroccan nationality projects to fruition.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <section class="section guestbook-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="guestbook-intro">These authentic testimonials illustrate the diversity of situations and the effectiveness of our personalized support.</p>

      <div class="testimonial-cards">
        <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-header">
            <div class="testimonial-profile">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar">DC</div>
              <div class="testimonial-identity">
                <h3>D. C.</h3>
                <p>Paris, France</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-success">
              <span class="success-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Certificate obtained in 11 months</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <div class="testimonial-quote"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <p>After years of unsuccessful attempts, Ezra Maroc managed to get me Moroccan nationality in less than a year. Their expertise and professionalism made all the difference.</p>
            <p>I had tried twice to compile my file myself, but I consistently ran into administrative roadblocks. The Ezra Maroc team immediately identified the weaknesses in my previous file and proposed an effective strategy.</p>
            <p>What particularly impressed me was their deep knowledge of Moroccan procedures and their ability to anticipate the administration's requests. Their regular follow-up also allowed me to remain calm throughout the process.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-header">
            <div class="testimonial-profile">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar">SB</div>
              <div class="testimonial-identity">
                <h3>S. B.</h3>
                <p>Montreal, Canada</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-success">
              <span class="success-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Certificate obtained in 14 months</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <div class="testimonial-quote"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <p>I feared that the distance and administrative complexity would be insurmountable obstacles, but the Ezra Maroc team handled everything with remarkable efficiency. Today, I am officially Moroccan!</p>
            <p>Residing in Canada, I thought the procedures would be particularly complicated for me. Ezra Maroc managed the entire process considering this constraint, minimizing my travel to only what was strictly necessary. Their online tracking platform kept me informed in real-time about my file's progress.</p>
            <p>On the day of my appointment at the court in Rabat, I was accompanied by their lawyer who ensured everything went perfectly. An emotional moment I will never forget.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-header">
            <div class="testimonial-profile">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar">ML</div>
              <div class="testimonial-identity">
                <h3>M. L.</h3>
                <p>New York, USA</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-success">
              <span class="success-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Certificate obtained in 16 months</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <div class="testimonial-quote"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <p>The transparency and professionalism of Ezra Maroc impressed me. I was always informed about the progress of my file, and their legal expertise helped overcome obstacles I thought were insurmountable.</p>
            <p>My case was particularly complex because my grandfather's documents were lost during the war. The Ezra Maroc team undertook real detective work, finding archives I never thought could be obtained.</p>
            <p>Their methodical approach and perseverance ultimately allowed for the creation of a solid file that convinced the Moroccan authorities. I am immensely grateful for their exceptional work.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 4 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-header">
            <div class="testimonial-profile">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar">RH</div>
              <div class="testimonial-identity">
                <h3>R. H.</h3>
                <p>Tel Aviv, Israel</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-success">
              <span class="success-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Certificate obtained in 19 months</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <div class="testimonial-quote"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <p>Obtaining Moroccan nationality was a dream I thought inaccessible, especially with the complexity of diplomatic relations. Ezra Maroc turned this dream into reality with remarkable professionalism.</p>
            <p>From our first conversation, I was reassured by their deep knowledge of the specific situation of Moroccan Jews who emigrated to Israel. They knew how to find solutions to every obstacle that arose.</p>
            <p>What struck me most was their ability to handle the emotional and identity aspects of my journey, beyond purely administrative considerations. Today, I can return to Morocco with my Moroccan passport and fully reconnect with my roots.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 5 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-header">
            <div class="testimonial-profile">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar">AB</div>
              <div class="testimonial-identity">
                <h3>A. B.</h3>
                <p>Lyon, France</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-success">
              <span class="success-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Certificate obtained in 13 months</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <div class="testimonial-quote"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <p>I want to express my deep gratitude to the entire Ezra Maroc team. Their expertise and dedication were decisive in the successful outcome of my Moroccan nationality application.</p>
            <p>Despite a complex family situation and partially missing documents, they managed to find innovative and legally sound solutions. Their knowledge of Moroccan administrative procedures saved me from numerous pitfalls and errors that could have significantly delayed my file.</p>
            <p>I highly recommend their services to anyone wishing to undertake this important and symbolic process.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 6 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-header">
            <div class="testimonial-profile">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar"><i class="fa-solid fa-users" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <div class="testimonial-identity">
                <h3>É. & N. M.</h3>
                <p>Marseille, France</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-success">
              <span class="success-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Certificates obtained in 15 months</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <div class="testimonial-quote"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <p>As a couple, we both wished to obtain Moroccan nationality, with different family situations. Ezra Maroc managed both our files in parallel with perfect coordination.</p>
            <p>Their personalized approach particularly touched us - they took the time to understand our family history and deep motivations. Their team showed remarkable patience and pedagogy in explaining each step of the process to us.</p>
            <p>We are infinitely grateful for their support, which allowed us to realize this important project for our family and our children.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 7 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-header">
            <div class="testimonial-profile">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar">RA</div>
              <div class="testimonial-identity">
                <h3>R. A.</h3>
                <p>Miami, USA</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-success">
              <span class="success-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Certificate obtained in 12 months</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <div class="testimonial-quote"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <p>Hiring Ezra Maroc was the best decision I made in my process of obtaining Moroccan nationality. Despite the distance and time difference, their team was always available and responsive.</p>
            <p>The file compilation was conducted with exemplary rigor, which certainly contributed to the relative speed of the process. Each document was perfectly prepared, translated, and legalized according to the specific requirements of the Moroccan authorities.</p>
            <p>I am particularly grateful for their support during my trip to Morocco for the final appointment. Their lawyer on site ensured a perfect transition and put me in the best conditions for this crucial step.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="guestbook-cta">
        <p>Do you also want to share your success or start your project?</p>
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary">Contact us today</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section engagement-section alt-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Our Commitment: <span>Your Story</span></h2>
      <div class="engagement-content">
        <p>Each testimonial is proof of our commitment to excellence and the success of our clients. Your unique journey deserves our full attention and dedicated expertise.</p>
        <p>We would be honored to help you write your own chapter in this guestbook and accompany you towards the recognition of your Moroccan nationality.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="cta-title">Ready to add your name to our Guestbook?</h2>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="contact.html#contact-form-container" class="btn btn-light">Request an Evaluation</a>
        <a href="process.html" class="btn btn-outline-light">See Our Process</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBanner lang={lang} />
</BaseLayout>
